#* {{quote-journal|en|date=November 10 2012|author=Amy Lawrence|title=Fulham's Mark Schwarzer saves late penalty in dramatic draw at Arsenal|newspaper=The Guardian|url=http://www.guardian.co.uk/football/2012/nov/10/arsenal-fulham-premier-league|passage='''Come''' the final whistle, Mikel Arteta lay flabbergasted on the turf.}}
